# Generator-emitted .rst pages (the cy* literalinclude pages written by
# interfacegen on each release run; see share/design/CODEGEN.md) are,
# like the generated Cython sources, committed on release branches so the
# Sphinx build works from a fresh checkout without re-running codegen.
# On the handcoded codegen base branch this directory only holds the
# handcoded pages (rocm.bindings.util.rst, hip.rst); the generated pages
# appear after the generator has run.
